      "text": "# Requirements\n- You should\nonly put the main\nentities\nthat are\nvisually\nvisible in the image.\n- Make sure the\nentities\nyou\nidentify\nare\nconcrete\nobjects , not\nabstract\nconcepts;\n,\u2192objects\nlike \u2019living room \u2019 or \u2019wind \u2019 should not be identified.\n- Make sure\nthese\nentity\nobjects\ncan be detected by an object\ndetector.\n- Only\noutput the\nentities\nthemselves , without\ntheir\nadjectives or descriptions ;\n,\u2192for example , output \u2019dog \u2019 instead of \u2019white dog \u2019.\n",
